        "content": "## AI OS — Notification Service\n**Reusable by all modules via Execute Workflow.**\n\nInput: { channel, to, subject, message }\n- channel: `telegram` | `email` | `whatsapp` | `all`\n- Uses one Switch (allMatchingOutputs) so `all` fans out to every channel.\n- Each channel node is continue-on-fail: one failing/unconfigured channel never blocks the others.\n- WhatsApp/Telegram creds + WhatsApp phone number ID are collected at setup.",
